Interview example: How RAG works

User
  │
  ▼
LLM receives question
  │
  ▼
Retriever searches Vector DB
  │
  ▼
Relevant documents found
  │
  ▼
Documents + User Prompt
  │
  ▼
LLM generates accurate answer

Without RAG, the model relies only on what it learned during training. With RAG, it can use up-to-date or private information.


Interview example: How MCP works

User
   │
   ▼
LLM
   │
   ▼
MCP Client
   │
   ▼
MCP Server
   │
   ├── GitHub
   ├── Database
   ├── Google Drive
   ├── Slack
   └── Internal APIs

MCP provides a standard way for AI applications to discover and use external tools, instead of every tool requiring its own custom integration.